1
00:00:36,100 --> 00:00:38,630
He comes from a police background,
after all.

2
00:00:38,630 --> 00:00:39,670
Chief,

3
00:00:39,810 --> 00:00:40,360
I'm worried...

4
00:00:40,360 --> 00:00:41,940
With that thing holding him in check,

5
00:00:41,940 --> 00:00:43,800
he has no choice but to work for me.

6
00:00:52,330 --> 00:00:54,530
Chief, he is here.

7
00:01:00,040 --> 00:01:02,540
[Eclipse in the Lost City]
[Episode 7]

8
00:01:05,300 --> 00:01:06,700
Kill me.

9
00:01:09,120 --> 00:01:09,720
Chief,

10
00:01:09,740 --> 00:01:10,539
I beg you.

11
00:01:10,570 --> 00:01:13,690
Kill me. Kill me.

12
00:01:23,460 --> 00:01:25,420
Chief, he is here.

13
00:01:25,240 --> 00:01:28,640
[Xu Qingdao, Chief of Shisha Gang]

14
00:01:33,630 --> 00:01:34,830
Officer Shen is here.

15
00:01:35,490 --> 00:01:36,289
Chief.

16
00:01:46,759 --> 00:01:48,360
I just took care of a traitor.

17
00:01:48,360 --> 00:01:49,640
Did it scare you?

18
00:01:49,880 --> 00:01:52,200
At the police station,

19
00:01:52,220 --> 00:01:55,580
all you usually do is slam a few desks
and smash a few cups.

20
00:01:56,080 --> 00:01:58,600
We're a rough bunch here.

21
00:01:58,950 --> 00:02:00,350
You're joking, Chief.

22
00:02:00,370 --> 00:02:02,280
How could I walk through
the Shisha Gang's doors

23
00:02:02,280 --> 00:02:04,200
without getting my hands bloody?

24
00:02:04,770 --> 00:02:06,410
You're straightforward.

25
00:02:06,780 --> 00:02:08,780
Then I'll get straight to the point.

26
00:02:09,280 --> 00:02:10,080
Hui.

27
00:02:14,890 --> 00:02:18,050
This is something new we got
from the Westerners.

28
00:02:18,170 --> 00:02:20,500
It's also the ticket into the Shisha Gang.

29
00:02:20,770 --> 00:02:21,790
Once you're injected with it,

30
00:02:21,790 --> 00:02:24,050
the poison will flare up every full moon.

31
00:02:24,780 --> 00:02:26,660
If you're not strong enough,

32
00:02:26,680 --> 00:02:28,920
the pain could kill you.

33
00:02:29,280 --> 00:02:30,720
As long as you behave,

34
00:02:30,920 --> 00:02:33,380
you'll get a maintenance dose
every 2 weeks.

35
00:02:33,750 --> 00:02:34,910
However,

36
00:02:35,030 --> 00:02:38,390
if anything goes wrong...

37
00:02:40,130 --> 00:02:41,860
This is what will happen to you.

38
00:02:44,180 --> 00:02:45,360
How about it, Officer Shen?

39
00:02:45,360 --> 00:02:46,840
Wanna think about it?

40
00:03:13,910 --> 00:03:14,870
Is this enough

41
00:03:15,440 --> 00:03:16,700
to satisfy you, Chief?

42
00:03:22,950 --> 00:03:23,840
Tianbai.

43
00:03:24,840 --> 00:03:25,400
Sit.

44
00:03:33,820 --> 00:03:35,180
Tianbai,

45
00:03:35,200 --> 00:03:36,660
you don't blame me, do you?

46
00:03:37,090 --> 00:03:38,220
In times like these,

47
00:03:38,600 --> 00:03:40,200
no one has it easy.

48
00:03:40,690 --> 00:03:42,810
You have to leave yourself a way out.

49
00:03:43,320 --> 00:03:44,360
Don't you agree?

50
00:03:45,310 --> 00:03:46,110
I understand.

51
00:03:46,990 --> 00:03:48,590
It's all for the Shisha Gang.

52
00:03:50,350 --> 00:03:51,150
Good.

53
00:03:51,790 --> 00:03:52,590
Good.

54
00:03:52,980 --> 00:03:54,440
You really are a smart man.

55
00:03:55,490 --> 00:03:57,730
Then I can trust you

56
00:03:58,210 --> 00:03:59,290
to handle this.

57
00:04:00,050 --> 00:04:00,850
Go ahead.

58
00:04:01,690 --> 00:04:02,650
In three days,

59
00:04:02,890 --> 00:04:05,090
the Shisha Gang
will be moving a shipment of arms

60
00:04:05,090 --> 00:04:06,550
to sell to those soldiers.

61
00:04:07,570 --> 00:04:08,770
If they're an army,

62
00:04:09,170 --> 00:04:11,100
why would they be short on weapons?

63
00:04:11,330 --> 00:04:12,930
They're no regular army.

64
00:04:13,290 --> 00:04:15,090
Just a bunch of thugs and bandits

65
00:04:15,290 --> 00:04:16,970
taking advantage of the chaos,

66
00:04:16,970 --> 00:04:18,920
looting and killing wherever they go,

67
00:04:18,920 --> 00:04:20,600
and fighting over territory.

68
00:04:20,850 --> 00:04:22,290
Hui has already made the arrangements.

69
00:04:22,290 --> 00:04:24,530
But he's reckless.

70
00:04:24,930 --> 00:04:26,590
I need you to keep an eye on him.

71
00:04:26,650 --> 00:04:28,370
Word must not get out.

72
00:04:29,890 --> 00:04:30,730
Remember,

73
00:04:31,610 --> 00:04:34,690
make sure the goods get there safely.

74
00:04:35,810 --> 00:04:36,610
Yes.

75
00:04:49,170 --> 00:04:50,450
Then prepare well.

76
00:04:58,330 --> 00:05:01,220
[Dashijie]

77
00:05:05,290 --> 00:05:06,090
Buddies.

78
00:05:06,400 --> 00:05:08,280
Drink all you want tonight.

79
00:05:08,450 --> 00:05:10,510
Don't you dare hold back on spending!

80
00:05:10,770 --> 00:05:11,410
Drink!

81
00:05:11,410 --> 00:05:12,330
Okay!

82
00:05:15,670 --> 00:05:16,710
I'm so useless.

83
00:05:17,890 --> 00:05:19,350
I've let the Qingtian Gang

84
00:05:19,570 --> 00:05:21,010
and the old man down.

85
00:05:25,210 --> 00:05:27,770
Isn't this Young Master Lu?

86
00:05:28,650 --> 00:05:30,650
You really are useless.

87
00:05:31,010 --> 00:05:32,650
Go home and cry to your mama.

88
00:05:33,020 --> 00:05:33,540
You...

89
00:05:38,810 --> 00:05:41,290
Come on.

90
00:05:41,650 --> 00:05:42,690
Come on.

91
00:05:44,170 --> 00:05:46,830
Don't forget the mission.
Don't cause trouble.

92
00:05:48,850 --> 00:05:50,380
I don't need you to teach me.

93
00:05:54,450 --> 00:05:55,290
Shen Tianbai.

94
00:05:56,770 --> 00:05:57,900
Seeing me like this,

95
00:05:58,380 --> 00:05:59,540
are you happy?

96
00:06:09,050 --> 00:06:10,050
You're drunk.

97
00:06:15,610 --> 00:06:17,410
Young Master, are you all right?

98
00:06:21,690 --> 00:06:22,490
Young Master.

99
00:06:24,090 --> 00:06:25,620
Zhuque has no reason to lie.

100
00:06:25,800 --> 00:06:27,200
But I still believe

101
00:06:27,340 --> 00:06:29,740
the old chief wouldn't have
transported drugs willingly.

102
00:06:29,740 --> 00:06:31,400
Someone must have forced him.

103
00:06:31,930 --> 00:06:32,930
I believe it, too.

104
00:06:34,810 --> 00:06:37,740
I'm going to get to the bottom of this,
no matter what.

105
00:06:39,890 --> 00:06:41,530
Shen Tianbai was commended for his work

106
00:06:41,530 --> 00:06:43,050
and stole Wu Ren's thunder,

107
00:06:43,050 --> 00:06:45,290
so Wu Ren set him up and got him kicked out
of the police force.

108
00:06:45,290 --> 00:06:46,350
He wanted revenge,

109
00:06:46,810 --> 00:06:48,270
so he turned to Xu Qingdao.

110
00:06:48,330 --> 00:06:49,970
The Shisha Gang had a condition, too.

111
00:06:49,970 --> 00:06:52,290
To join,
he first had to prove his loyalty

112
00:06:52,450 --> 00:06:54,130
by getting rid of someone
who could expose them.

113
00:06:54,130 --> 00:06:55,409
And that person was Zhuque,

114
00:06:55,409 --> 00:06:58,290
the mole inside our Qingtian Gang.

115
00:06:58,970 --> 00:07:00,770
That's why he faked his amnesia,

116
00:07:01,100 --> 00:07:02,520
went undercover around me,

117
00:07:02,520 --> 00:07:03,920
and put on this whole act.

118
00:07:05,010 --> 00:07:06,170
Shen Tianbai,

119
00:07:06,480 --> 00:07:08,880
you really know how to bend
when you have to.

120
00:07:10,450 --> 00:07:11,250
Right.

121
00:07:11,970 --> 00:07:13,970
You've always been this kind of person.

122
00:07:13,970 --> 00:07:15,690
Back then, it was to get an education.

123
00:07:15,690 --> 00:07:18,090
Now, it's for revenge.

124
00:07:22,370 --> 00:07:23,430
Drug trafficking.

125
00:07:25,570 --> 00:07:26,630
Drug trafficking.

126
00:07:27,650 --> 00:07:29,610
If that batch of goods was really drugs,

127
00:07:29,610 --> 00:07:33,210
then Shen Tianbai shooting him
was understandable.

128
00:07:34,210 --> 00:07:36,010
Since the drugs are related
to the Shisha Gang,

129
00:07:36,010 --> 00:07:39,940
then maybe Shen Tianbai joining
the Shisha Gang isn't such a bad thing.

130
00:07:42,090 --> 00:07:42,890
Young Master,

131
00:07:42,890 --> 00:07:45,170
what should we do next?

132
00:07:46,620 --> 00:07:48,950
Help Shen Tianbai rise through the ranks.

133
00:07:49,630 --> 00:07:51,290
Why are you still helping him?

134
00:07:51,730 --> 00:07:53,450
He is a catfish.

135
00:07:53,930 --> 00:07:56,650
Put a catfish in the water,
and it'll stir things up.

136
00:07:56,650 --> 00:07:58,580
Once Shen Tianbai enters the game,

137
00:07:58,770 --> 00:08:00,500
he's bound to muddy the waters.

138
00:08:00,600 --> 00:08:01,910
Once the waters are muddied,

139
00:08:01,910 --> 00:08:05,110
we'll have our chance to move in.

140
00:08:08,370 --> 00:08:09,930
That bastard Hui.

141
00:08:10,010 --> 00:08:11,340
He's usually so stingy.

142
00:08:11,370 --> 00:08:13,190
But today,
he's suddenly spending like crazy.

143
00:08:13,190 --> 00:08:14,790
There must be a big shipment.

144
00:08:15,630 --> 00:08:16,830
Soot.

145
00:08:16,860 --> 00:08:17,940
Rust.

146
00:08:17,970 --> 00:08:18,830
Train station.

147
00:08:21,970 --> 00:08:23,000
You, Shen,

148
00:08:23,330 --> 00:08:25,610
are you looking down on me?

149
00:08:27,330 --> 00:08:28,330
I'm telling you.

150
00:08:28,530 --> 00:08:30,010
As long as I'm here,

151
00:08:30,090 --> 00:08:32,220
I won't let even a mosquito get past me.

152
00:08:32,289 --> 00:08:34,530
Who could possibly steal this shipment?

153
00:08:34,530 --> 00:08:35,730
This is the chief's order.

154
00:08:35,730 --> 00:08:36,929
The goods are in the carriage.

155
00:08:36,929 --> 00:08:38,059
Go see for yourself.

156
00:08:52,580 --> 00:08:54,380
Who did this?

157
00:09:07,580 --> 00:09:08,980
Hui, over here!

158
00:09:40,890 --> 00:09:42,380
Lure the tiger away from its lair.

159
00:09:42,380 --> 00:09:43,580
What a coincidence.

160
00:09:44,730 --> 00:09:45,730
Officer Shen.

161
00:09:48,420 --> 00:09:48,940
No.

162
00:09:49,410 --> 00:09:50,410
That's not right.

163
00:09:50,530 --> 00:09:52,250
You're not an officer anymore.

164
00:09:52,250 --> 00:09:54,510
You're just a dog kept by the Shisha Gang.

165
00:09:56,810 --> 00:09:57,610
It's too late.

166
00:09:58,320 --> 00:09:59,400
There's no time.

167
00:10:04,210 --> 00:10:05,810
You didn't hijack the goods.

168
00:10:05,970 --> 00:10:07,370
The goods are still in the carriage.

169
00:10:07,370 --> 00:10:08,210
Smart.

170
00:10:08,810 --> 00:10:09,890
But now,

171
00:10:10,410 --> 00:10:12,370
the goods are ours.

172
00:10:13,250 --> 00:10:15,610
When would I have had time
to move all that cargo?

173
00:10:15,610 --> 00:10:17,800
I just switched out a few boxes
on the outside,

174
00:10:17,800 --> 00:10:19,000
and Hui fell for it.

175
00:10:28,970 --> 00:10:31,170
Why go to all this trouble

176
00:10:31,460 --> 00:10:32,900
just to pull this off?

177
00:10:34,980 --> 00:10:37,420
Why go to all that trouble

178
00:10:38,130 --> 00:10:39,860
to infiltrate the Shisha Gang?

179
00:10:50,570 --> 00:10:51,700
Where are the goods?

180
00:10:52,420 --> 00:10:53,620
Spare my life, Chief.

181
00:10:53,670 --> 00:10:54,960
It's all Shen Tianbai's fault.

182
00:10:54,960 --> 00:10:56,290
He didn't keep a close eye on the goods.

183
00:10:56,290 --> 00:10:58,050
Lu Ye found out about it.

184
00:10:58,070 --> 00:10:59,800
He might be involved in it, too.

185
00:11:02,010 --> 00:11:03,940
You sure know how to keep your cool.

186
00:11:06,890 --> 00:11:08,330
As for the leak,

187
00:11:08,730 --> 00:11:10,570
the innocent have nothing to fear.

188
00:11:10,570 --> 00:11:11,770
As for that shipment,

189
00:11:12,250 --> 00:11:13,980
it might not be such a bad thing.

190
00:11:14,290 --> 00:11:15,220
What do you mean?

191
00:11:15,570 --> 00:11:17,970
There's a problem
with that batch of goods.

192
00:11:28,610 --> 00:11:29,490
Look, Chief.

193
00:11:30,450 --> 00:11:32,450
There are scratches on these bullets.

194
00:11:32,450 --> 00:11:34,290
They'd have to be removed and reloaded

195
00:11:34,290 --> 00:11:35,810
to leave marks like these.

196
00:11:36,370 --> 00:11:38,810
That means this ammo has been used before.

197
00:11:39,310 --> 00:11:42,790
Did someone skim a little off the top,

198
00:11:42,970 --> 00:11:44,630
and that's how this happened?

199
00:11:45,010 --> 00:11:46,650
Those thugs with guns
are fighting over territory.

200
00:11:46,650 --> 00:11:48,170
They're not people we want to mess with.

201
00:11:48,170 --> 00:11:50,090
If they find out about this,

202
00:11:50,410 --> 00:11:52,370
they'll come after us for it.

203
00:11:52,550 --> 00:11:55,350
Now that the Qingtian Gang
has taken the shipment,

204
00:11:56,650 --> 00:11:58,780
they've taken the fall for us instead.

205
00:11:59,210 --> 00:12:02,210
So what do you suggest we do next?

206
00:12:04,170 --> 00:12:05,850
Replace it with a better shipment.

207
00:12:05,850 --> 00:12:07,170
Do you have another source?

208
00:12:07,170 --> 00:12:10,300
I still have a few connections
from my years on the force.

209
00:12:11,290 --> 00:12:13,650
As long as we're willing to pay enough,

210
00:12:14,330 --> 00:12:15,930
we can make anything happen.

211
00:12:18,210 --> 00:12:19,870
I'll leave this matter to you.

212
00:12:20,410 --> 00:12:21,810
Yes, Chief.

213
00:12:22,010 --> 00:12:24,140
I'll get in touch with them right away.

214
00:12:25,420 --> 00:12:26,820
Go take your punishment.

215
00:12:27,690 --> 00:12:28,330
Yes.

216
00:12:40,290 --> 00:12:41,090
Master.

217
00:12:42,850 --> 00:12:44,370
I've found it.
